designer_notes = "A DEER'S CARCASS (skinning, Luke's H1, 2026-11-07; built 2026-11-09, HERBALISM_HUNTING_PREP.md §7 step 4): left where a deer fell (its FoeDef's carcass), never placed by a level. Skinned with a KNIFE of tier 1 (Luke, 2026-11-09) at Skinning rank 1. SEVERAL HIDES (Luke, 2026-11-10: \"like a node depletion and good rounds reward more up to a cap\"): AFK a hide every 5 s, each the last with 35 %, never more than 4 (max_items): about 2.3 a deer. ITS ROUND, THE CUT LINE (H4: drag the knife along the line, off it tears): a round skins the WHOLE carcass (whole_round): it pays that 2.3 x the round's factor (0.75 at a score of 0 to 1.25 at full: about 1.8 to 2.9 hides), never past the 4, and the carcass is worked out as it ends. Its look is the deer held at its Death clip's end (art/animals/deer_carcass.tscn); skinned, it sinks away (the rubble look, dark red) and is taken away. Its top damager's alone regents.carcass_own_s, then anyone's; it rots away after regents.carcass_rot_s. Claude's numbers, Luke's to change."
